---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Refund Policy" description="Refund Policy of New Life Integration & Wellbeing Network CLG.">
    
    <section class="bg-linear-to-b from-teal-950/40 via-background to-background pt-20 pb-12 text-center relative border-b border-border/40">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary tracking-wider uppercase mb-2 block">💳 Fair & Transparent</span>
            <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-4">Refund Policy</h1>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                Our guidelines on cancellations, ticket transfers, and refunds for paid community workshops and programs.
            </p>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground/60 mt-3 font-medium">Last updated: May 27, 2026</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground space-y-6">
            
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">1. Overview</h2>
            <p>
                <strong>New Life Integration & Wellbeing Network CLG</strong> ("we", "us", "our") is a non-profit volunteer network. Certain motivational events (like "Wiz at Life"), leadership sessions, or workshops may charge a small cost to cover venues, study booklets, and local catering. We are committed to ensuring fairness and transparency in all financial transactions. 
            </p>
            <p>
                By registering for and paying for any of our services, you agree to the terms set out in this policy. All amounts are processed in Euro (EUR).
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">2. Event Tickets & Workshops</h2>
            <p>The following refund schedule applies to our paid community events, seminars, workshops, and gatherings:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
                <li><strong>More than 7 days before the event:</strong> 100% Refund.</li>
                <li><strong>3–7 days before the event:</strong> 50% Refund.</li>
                <li><strong>Less than 3 days before the event:</strong> No Refund.</li>
                <li><strong>Processing Time:</strong> Approved refunds will be processed within 7-10 business days.</li>
            </ul>
            <p><em>Exceptions:</em> As no payment is involved, free events are fully excluded from this policy. Special events may have custom terms communicated during booking.</p>

            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">3. Leadership Program Fees</h2>
            <p>The following rules apply to our multi-session Leadership Programmes:</p>
            <p><strong>Before the Program Starts:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
                <li>More than 14 days before start date: Full refund minus a €50 administration fee.</li>
                <li>7–14 days before start date: 50% refund.</li>
                <li>Less than 7 days before start date: No refund.</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong>After the Program Starts:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
                <li>Within the first week: Pro-rated refund minus a €100 administration fee.</li>
                <li>After the first week: No refund will be issued.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">4. Custom Grant Support Services</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
                <li><strong>Before work begins:</strong> Full refund minus a 20% commitment deposit.</li>
                <li><strong>After work begins:</strong> Partial refund calculated strictly based on work already completed.</li>
                <li><strong>After deliverables are sent:</strong> Non-refundable.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">5. Event Cancellations by the Organisation</h2>
            <p>
                In rare circumstances where an event must be cancelled or significantly rescheduled due to extreme weather, venue issues, or facilitator availability, all registered participants will be offered a <strong>full 100% refund</strong> or the option to transfer their registration to the rescheduled date.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">6. Special Circumstances</h2>
            <p>
                We handle exceptional situations with sensitivity. At our sole discretion, a full refund or future credit may be offered regardless of the schedules above in cases of <strong>serious illness</strong> (supported by medical documentation) or <strong>bereavement</strong>.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">7. Ticket Transfers</h2>
            <p>As an alternative to a refund, you are always welcome to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
                <li><strong>Transfer to another person:</strong> Provided you notify us at least 48 hours before the event begins.</li>
                <li><strong>Transfer to a future event:</strong> Subject to availability, you may transfer your slot to a future event of equal value.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">8. Non-Refundable Items</h2>
            <p>The following items cannot be refunded under any circumstances: Completed services, digital downloads once accessed, specific administrative fees, and voluntary donations.</p>

            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">9. How to Request a Refund & Contact Us</h2>
            <p>
                To request a refund or transfer, please send an email to <a href="mailto:info@lifeintegration.ie" class="text-primary hover:underline font-semibold">info@lifeintegration.ie</a> containing your full name, purchase date, the name/date of the event, and the reason for your request. We review all requests within 3 business days.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

</Layout>